f Busan. Family tensions mount as Rebecca struggles with her father's new family. And a shocking revelation about David's past with Juno is revealed during a violent confrontation at a marina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3RCFL9ZVEhuOgA6TFmMFpxHuYun.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0J1dHRlcmZseSUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.4","title":"Pohang","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After abducting Oliver, David and Rebecca use the information they gather from him to devise a plan to go after Juno, taking them back to Seoul, where Gun and Caddis are waiting.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fdCN2YmZwAphzXJ6RHDbRe4dmYH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0J1dHRlcmZseSUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.5","title":"Seoul","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Juno interrogates Oliver and discovers he betrayed her while being held captive by David. Meanwhile, David and Rebecca carry out a PSYOP campaign against Juno, aimed at dividing her and Oliver and bringing down Caddis once and for all.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uVnX0erLUCgVcbKjyEuiP48i2ny.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0J1dHRlcmZseSUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv.1.6","title":"Annyeong","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-08-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"David pursues Rebecca after she's captured by Juno and Caddis operatives, leading to a high-speed chase and brutal ambush at an abandoned factory site.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5wR23XiJu0NvOzY6OMx9mrW7sGj.jpg"}]}}